# Release signing artefacts (key.properties, *.jks, *.keystore) are ignored by
# android/.gitignore — do not duplicate the patterns here. See docs/RELEASE_SIGNING.md.

# On-device walkthrough screenshots. Kept on the machine that took them, never
# committed: they are evidence for one debug session, not a repo artefact, and a
# single pass is ~12 MB of PNGs that git can never shrink again. Findings that
# matter from a pass belong in DESIGN_ISSUES.md / KNOWN_BUGS.md as text.
docs/device_pass/
